{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18959","headline":"河南观察使故相国袁公挽歌三首 三 · 刘禹锡","name":"河南观察使故相国袁公挽歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返葬三千里，荆衡达帝畿。\n逢人即故吏，拜奠尽沾衣。\n地得青乌相，宾惊白鹤飞。\n五公碑尚在，今日亦同归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}